Package: commfigR
Title: Cell-Cell Communication Figures from Existing Results
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Jiang", family = "Congxin", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jcx981212@163.com")
Author: Jiang Congxin
Maintainer: Jiang Congxin <jcx981212@163.com>
Description: Draw cell-cell communication figures from exported interaction tables. Validates source data, keeps conditions separate, records display selections, and exports artwork with methods and reproducible task reports. Uses ncfigR for shared figure styling, export and visual review.
